# Tactical-genome screen arm (log 2026-09-08): the standing base with
# retreat 12 -- a released wave disbands and re-gathers when its
# survivors fall below min(12, its size at release), so the sustained 25-wave regroups below half of itself;
# today's constant disbands at 3, near annihilation. Distinct from
# the dead per-unit flee reflexes: the GROUP goes home to join the
# next wave. Every other line is byte-identical to the base.
